{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:06 2026-08-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:06 2026-08-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:06 2026-08-18 HKT</p><p>國際足協宣布解僱首席營運官拉穆爾，他曾經在主席恩芬天奴提出出售世界盃股權的時候，公開發文批評對方。曼聯的般奴費南迪斯獲得加拉塔沙雷的青睞，後者提出雙倍人工的合約利誘，但曼聯堅拒任何金額的報價。EA Sports FC27公能力值前27位球員，麥巴比和夏蘭特並列第一。維卡里奧將由熱刺外借祖雲達斯，主帥史巴列堤感到滿意，又解釋為何對方並非首選。</p><img alt=\"曾公開批評恩芬天奴的拉穆爾被炒。路透社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e771240791f4c06a7d2b17bf68f489e4/2026-08/FIFA-Executive-Leaves_49244--eedba.jpg\"/><img alt=\"曼聯表明不會接受任何報價。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e25e306f41b95acb1dc02b4f4e96766/2026-08/AFP__20260815__iwanczuk-manchest260815_npODl__v1__HighRes__ManchesterUnitedVAcMilanF.jpg\"/><img alt=\"EA Sports FC27公布能力值前27名球員。EA Sports官網\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dffbb2521ba7cf6faa19dd3791a52e0f/2026-08/fc27-top-27-men-1-16x9.jpg\"/><img alt=\"車路士為尼圖標價1億鎊。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/093a314c5c57b98a22d985e3800ff556/2026-08/AFP__20260805__C3ZZ92X__v1__HighRes__FblHkgEngItaPrSerieaChelseaJuventus.jpg\"/><img alt=\"維卡里奧在熱刺失去正選。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b2a2a30a7618894bbca94c836ab361a8/2026-08/AFP__20260318__bretonhernandez-tottenha260318_npKhV__v1__HighRes__TottenhamHotspurFc.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T00:47:08.841413+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":254,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}